{"id": "1545628711817318503", "channel_id": "1545628711817318503", "author_id": "790130205791354900", "author_name": "kullervo47.", "content": "Im sure I speak for everyone here when I say that I truly do love this game, its special and the only gacha i have ever given money too, not because i felt i needed too but because of my love for the game and the devs who make it. You NEED to listen to the community and talk to us tho because if you dont the game will die and it will be entirely on light and the higher ups fault for taking defeat from the jaws of victory. \n\n1. revert the affinity changes, they are awful and feel terrible, and the reward for even grinding it is genuinely worse than rewards in games that use ai gen for their art somehow, its lazy and feels like a spit in everyones face\n\n2. balance, I know its not easy but COME ON, the one thing people do NOT want (whales and f2p alike) is fights that arent hard mechanically but because of insane numbers they have, and thats exaclty what you gave us, it feels like you genuenly dont play the game yourselves or even know what your players want\n\n3. communication, when you backpedal changes proposed within a day then unbackpedal them a day later but take days of silence on the biggest controversy the game has had and the potential death of it feels so bad for us, like you dont care about the community.\n\nI say these things out of love, I genuinely love the game and its one of my favorites so please dont destroy it with some of the dumbest decisions ive seen in gacha games.", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T02:56:41.290000+00:00", "thread_id": "1545628711817318503", "reactions": [{"emoji": "Celeste_agree", "emoji_id": "1400771815076528258", "count": 6}], "thread_title": "PLEASE listen to us, we want the game to not eos", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1542484945447026708", "1542484013652910141"], "is_thread_starter": true}
